---
import YogaLayout from '../../../layouts/YogaLayout.astro';
---
<YogaLayout title="ご参加の準備 | Setsuko Hata Yoga"
  description="単発参加と月額会員の比較、対面クラス・オンラインクラス・特別クラス・大阪限定会員・全国オンライン会員のご案内。"
  locale="ja"
  active="classes"
>

        <section class=" ja-band ja-band-sage" data-lt="1">
          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10">
            <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">Before your class</p>
            <h1 class="mt-6 max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl leading-[1.2] text-brand-espresso md:text-6xl md:leading-[1.1]">ご参加の準備</h1>
            <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-loose text-brand-espresso">ご予約ありがとうございます。当日までのお支払い、お食事のタイミング、持ち物、会場へのアクセスをご確認ください。</p>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-paper">
          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-6 md:px-10">
            <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss ja-eyebrow">ご参加について</p>
            <div class="mt-10">
              <div class="space-y-4">
                <details class="group border border-brand-espresso/15 bg-white" open>
                  <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 px-7 py-6 md:px-9">
                    <span class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl">🏦 お支払い</span>
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 font-display text-3xl leading-none text-brand-moss transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
                  </summary>
                  <div class="border-t border-brand-espresso/10 px-7 pb-8 pt-6 md:px-9"><div class="space-y-2 text-base leading-loose text-brand-espresso/85"><p>当日までに銀行振込にてお願いいたします。</p><p>三井住友銀行　玉造支店（110）</p><p>普通　6481268</p><p>口座名義：ハタ セツコ</p></div></div>
                </details>
                <details class="group border border-brand-espresso/15 bg-white">
                  <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 px-7 py-6 md:px-9">
                    <span class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl">🍀 キャンセルポリシー</span>
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 font-display text-3xl leading-none text-brand-moss transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
                  </summary>
                  <div class="border-t border-brand-espresso/10 px-7 pb-8 pt-6 md:px-9"><div class="space-y-2 text-base leading-loose text-brand-espresso/85"><p>前日：受講料の50％</p><p>当日：受講料の100％</p></div></div>
                </details>
                <details class="group border border-brand-espresso/15 bg-white">
                  <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 px-7 py-6 md:px-9">
                    <span class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl">⏰ 当日のご案内</span>
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 font-display text-3xl leading-none text-brand-moss transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
                  </summary>
                  <div class="border-t border-brand-espresso/10 px-7 pb-8 pt-6 md:px-9"><div class="space-y-2 text-base leading-loose text-brand-espresso/85"><p>開始10分前までにお越しください</p><p>開始5分前までにお着替えをお済ませください</p><p>スタジオ内でお着替えいただけます</p></div></div>
                </details>
                <details class="group border border-brand-espresso/15 bg-white">
                  <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 px-7 py-6 md:px-9">
                    <span class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl">🍽 お食事について</span>
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 font-display text-3xl leading-none text-brand-moss transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
                  </summary>
                  <div class="border-t border-brand-espresso/10 px-7 pb-8 pt-6 md:px-9"><div class="space-y-2 text-base leading-loose text-brand-espresso/85"><p>しっかりした食事：4時間あける</p><p>軽食・果物：2時間半あける</p><p>ジュース・お茶：1時間半あける</p><p>お水：制限ありません</p></div></div>
                </details>
                <details class="group border border-brand-espresso/15 bg-white">
                  <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 px-7 py-6 md:px-9">
                    <span class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl">👕 持ち物</span>
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 font-display text-3xl leading-none text-brand-moss transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
                  </summary>
                  <div class="border-t border-brand-espresso/10 px-7 pb-8 pt-6 md:px-9"><div class="space-y-2 text-base leading-loose text-brand-espresso/85"><p>お水</p><p>動きやすい綿100％の服装</p></div></div>
                </details>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-brand-cream/60">
          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10">
            <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss ja-eyebrow">会場</p>
            <div class="mt-10"><div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16">
              <div>
                <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-brand-moss ja-sublabel">📍 東京会場</p>
                <p class="mt-5 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">東京都港区三田5丁目1-2-301</p>
                <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-loose text-brand-espresso/85">麻布十番駅・白金高輪駅より徒歩約10分<br />三田駅・田町駅より徒歩約10分</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-brand-moss ja-sublabel">📍 大阪会場</p>
                <p class="mt-5 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">カタリーナホール玉造 3階</p>
                <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-loose text-brand-espresso/85">〒543-0014<br />大阪府大阪市天王寺区玉造元町3-1</p>
                <p class="mt-4"><a href="https://yahoo.jp/oYcvi4" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="border-b border-brand-espresso pb-0.5 text-base hover:opacity-70">🔗 地図はこちら</a></p>
                <div class="mt-5 space-y-1 text-base leading-loose text-brand-espresso/85"><p>JR大阪環状線 玉造駅 北口改札より徒歩すぐ（「風の街」の向かい）</p><p>大阪メトロ長堀鶴見緑地線 玉造駅 徒歩すぐ</p></div>
              </div>
            </div></div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class=" ja-band ja-band-sand" data-lt="1">
          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-6 md:px-10 text-center">
            <h2 class="font-display text-3xl leading-[1.3] text-brand-espresso md:text-4xl">ご不明な点はお気軽に</h2>
            <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-loose text-brand-espresso">当日の流れやお支払いについてご質問があれば、いつでもご連絡ください。</p>
            <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-5"><a href="/hatha-yoga/ja/contact/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white px-9 py-4 text-[14px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-espresso transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-brand-tan active:translate-y-px">お問い合わせ</a></div>
          </div>
        </section>
</YogaLayout>
